{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國遊戲開發商Valve近日再次引發玩家對《半條命3》（Half-Life 3）的猜測。長期參與Valve遊戲配樂工作的作曲家邁克·莫拉斯基（Mike Morasky）在2026年遊戲音頻大會GameSoundCon的一場問答活動中，公開提到了內部代號「HLX」。由於這一代號多年來一直被玩家和數據挖掘者與傳聞中的《半條命》新作聯繫在一起，這次罕見的公開提及迅速引發關注。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583430.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:59:37.625322+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:51:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_hash":"6d7e97a8f9c29f05e669680ec3ccb5b2ff715840320da772a37df697260ed5b1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}